        "TileImage": "$($repository 5ac2e193-5309-4ed8-a759-7019abc15b94).Image",
        "Description": "In the basement of a farmhouse in a Colorado milita base, William Candler is being interrogated. Our client has hired us to kill everyone involved in this interrogation to prevent any information Candler has from spreading.\r\rThe client also demands that this contract is completed leaving as little evidence as possible - including leaving through a hidden passage to avoid being seen fleeing.\r\rThey&apos;ve also inexplicably said they&apos;d prefer if the guards were poisoned and the other two blown up.",
